Hi Avery,

Your Zoom Workplace annual plan renews in May. Ahead of that, here are a few features included in your plan that most accounts your size haven't turned on:

- Zoom Scheduler: booking pages that sync with Google Calendar, included with Workplace Business
- Team Chat channels with external guests
- Zoom Docs: collaborative documents generated from meeting summaries
- Workspace reservations, if you have an office

Upgrade paths: accounts moving from Business to Business Plus before renewal get the first three months of the difference waived. Details in the billing portal.

Explore your plan: https://zoom.us/account/plan?ref=pre-renewal

